 ****************** CONTROL SECTION
  'Soil1'      Name of this soil profile, max 10 characters
  1.0     CONFRC    Old-force-unit  = CONFRC * New-force-unit  1MN  = 1000*1KN
  1.0     CONLTH    Old-length-unit = CONLTH * New-length-unit  1M  = 3.28*1FT
  2       NUMLAYM   Number of main soil layers (max is 1000)
  0       NUMDSP    Number of Z-levels with given soil displacements (max is 50)
  10.0    GAMMAW    Unit weight of water (10.0 kN/m3 in SI-units)
  101.3   ATMPRS    Atmospheric pressure (101.3 kN/m2 in SI-units)
  0.00       ZCYCL     Z-level down to which cyclic P-Y data shall be generated
  96   SUSTIF    Use stiff clay P-Y procedures if Su.GT.SUSTIF (API only)
  2       JPRINT    Printed output code (0=None 1=Some 2=Full)
  1       JECHO     Echo print of input file NF14 to file NF16 (0=No 1=Yes)

 ****************** MATERIAL COEFFICIENTS SECTION
  1.000   SFTPHI    Material coefficient on tan(phi)
  1.000   SFSU      Material coefficient on undrained shear strength
  1.000   SFSKF     Material coefficient on pile skin friction
  1.000   SFSIGT    Material coefficient on pile tip resistance

 ****************** PILE DIAMETERS AND GROUP EFFECTS SECTION
  1       NUMDIA    Number of pile diam for which P-Y/T-Z/Q-Z data is wanted (max is 20)
  1.000             'NUMDIA' pile diameters in increasing order
  0       ESOL0     E-soil for lateral group effect calc: Eh(Z)=ESOL0+ESOL1*Z
  0       ESOL1     ESOL0 = Eh-soil at Z=0.0 , ESOL1 = dEh/dZ , Z = Z-coord
  1.0       EVHRAT    Ratio Ev(Z)/Eh(Z), Ev(Z) = E-soil for axial group effect
  0.5     POSAVR    Soil average Poisson's ratio for group effects

 ****************** SOIL SURFACE AND GROUND WATER SECTION
  0.000    ZSURF     Z-level of non-scoured soil surface
  0.00    SCRGEN    Depth of general scour below 'ZSURF'
  0.00    SCRLOC    Depth of local scour below 'ZSURF'
  20    SLOPE     Side slope (degrees) of local scour holes
  0.000    ZGRWT     Z-level of ground water table
  10      GAMPWP    Unit weight of ground water (used to find pore water prss)

 ****************** LOADS AT SOIL SURFACE SECTION
    0.0   SIGSRF    Vertical stress at surface
    0.0   DPEMB     Vertical stress under embankment loading
    0.0   AEMB      Width 'A' of embankment sloping part
    0.0   BEMB      Pile position w.r.t. embankment toe (positive outside)
    0.0   DPCIRC    Vertical stress under circular loaded area
    0.0   RADIUS    Radius of circular loaded area (pile is in centre)
      0   NUMFRC    Number of vertical point forces at soil surface (max is 45)
           0        Point force values
           0.0      Horizontal distance to pile axis 

